    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE FAMILY</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350460/extras/f9704bb3f95d367629ed8506cdd8ff48.poster.avif?t=1717424368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350460/extras/f9704bb3f95d367629ed8506cdd8ff48.webm?t=1717424368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350460/extras/f9704bb3f95d367629ed8506cdd8ff48.mp4?t=1717424368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350460/extras/9597b01dae48b9bd175174cc0d600640.poster.avif?t=1717424368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350460/extras/9597b01dae48b9bd175174cc0d600640.webm?t=1717424368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Chickenauts is a companion based, action roguelike game where you battle evil Alien Chickens who've abducted your beloved flock. Free and mutate your chickens to defeat a myriad of foes, explore various spaceship environments and unravel secrets of the Chickens from outer space!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350460/extras/a84b324c86c106ccc23c6075ee0d78f0.poster.avif?t=1717424368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350460/extras/a84b324c86c106ccc23c6075ee0d78f0.webm?t=1717424368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Companion Chickens</strong>:<br>You will free and unlock various controllable chickens companions that will help you defeat the bad guys.<br></li><li><strong>Mutations</strong>:<br>During combat you will find various mutations for you and your companion. Combine them to find the best synergies.<br></li><li><strong>Potions</strong>:<br>In spaceship you will find potions that will have positive and negative effects that are randomly generated and lead to funny and interesting combinations.<br></li><li><strong>Numerous enemies and bosses</strong>:<br>You will have to face various different enemies and each of them have different approach in stopping you from going further. <br></li><li><strong>Many gameplay hours</strong>:<br>Our levels, potions and upgrade drops are randomly generated leading to every playthrough feel different.<br></li><li><strong>Controller support</strong>:<br>Our game supports all of the common controllers.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350460/extras/f9704bb3f95d367629ed8506cdd8ff48.poster.avif?t=1717424368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350460/extras/f9704bb3f95d367629ed8506cdd8ff48.webm?t=1717424368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350460/extras/f9704bb3f95d367629ed8506cdd8ff48.mp4?t=1717424368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350460/extras/9597b01dae48b9bd175174cc0d600640.poster.avif?t=1717424368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350460/extras/9597b01dae48b9bd175174cc0d600640.webm?t=1717424368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Chickenauts is a companion based, action roguelike game where you battle evil Alien Chickens who've abducted your beloved flock. Free and mutate your chickens to defeat a myriad of foes, explore various spaceship environments and unravel secrets of the Chickens from outer space!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350460/extras/a84b324c86c106ccc23c6075ee0d78f0.poster.avif?t=1717424368\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350460/extras/a84b324c86c106ccc23c6075ee0d78f0.webm?t=1717424368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Companion Chickens</strong>:<br>You will free and unlock various controllable chickens companions that will help you defeat the bad guys.<br></li><li><strong>Mutations</strong>:<br>During combat you will find various mutations for you and your companion. Combine them to find the best synergies.<br></li><li><strong>Potions</strong>:<br>In spaceship you will find potions that will have positive and negative effects that are randomly generated and lead to funny and interesting combinations.<br></li><li><strong>Numerous enemies and bosses</strong>:<br>You will have to face various different enemies and each of them have different approach in stopping you from going further. <br></li><li><strong>Many gameplay hours</strong>:<br>Our levels, potions and upgrade drops are randomly generated leading to every playthrough feel different.<br></li><li><strong>Controller support</strong>:<br>Our game supports all of the common controllers.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Chickenauts is a companion based, action roguelike game where you battle evil Alien Chickens who've abducted your beloved flock. Free and mutate your chickens to defeat a myriad of foes, explore various spaceship environments and unravel secrets of the Chickens from outer space!",
